{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the story... a famous singer gets her voice stolen. Now, you must help her get it back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971940/extras/33897cf56bffde3f9d0751b21ff385f4.avif?t=1761768548\" width=1560 height=570 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karu is a famous singer from Solar City who created a band called &quot;Too!&quot; with some of her classmates, back when she was still in university. During one of their concerts, someone stole Karu's voice using a magic spell! Karu, along with the other members of her band, must find whoever is responsible for stealing her voice and force them to give it back!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ playable characters! Some of them even have abilities of their own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate colors for all characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial levels for every character in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight worlds with two levels each (each level has its own unique music track.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight special levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rankings unique to each character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input remapping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D version of the game's overworld for low end computers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971940?t=1761768548","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageb